{"v":3,"catch":"感受一口氣清除連接顆粒的快感！","desc":"這款益智遊戲帶來一種令人滿足的體驗，將相同顏色的顆粒連接在一起並一口氣清除。你連接的顆粒越多，清除時獲得的分數就越高。\n\n連接相同顏色的顆粒，使其消失。在“ARRANGE”模式中，會出現特殊顆粒，而在“+”模式中，關卡會擴大，提供更多的遊戲空間。","publisher":"KEMCO","release":"2025-10-02","genres":["益智","街機"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","葡萄牙文","俄文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a2acf0e9e320f47f1349bb0048ee68547b651b77579954d0b191d8aa3d811800.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/697994328481767835602c9834839059e2bb9848ccc6c6122c15a1dd071ffb5e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/47dd94f2ec8994ed92ee782bc7936b86cff3eaded5e4ed34eaaff9b80b4e36bb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9b84246ee4ab5a5dc4269e95b3d9d4032dcf51a70d536d0614e21d3a5437c102.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1527381e0b66add4953e7c76f002dde0b9fe6c3e03bb4c3a57b35448cfc3bdbb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/887f3403c3ad2a057d853de342676a1402cb07681812b1f6b0d2a89169d335bb.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ae601ff2a000","dlc":[]}